6
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:18,570
I'm Daniel.

7
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:19,730
And I'm Sophie.

8
00:00:20,170 --> 00:00:27,000
We're so happy you're joining us today because this episode is going to help you sound more professional and confident at work.

9
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:27,770
That's right.

10
